   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><dateline><date when="1942-01-17">January 17, 1942</date></dateline><lb/>
               <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr. Paul Tillich</rs><lb/> Union
               Theological Seminary<lb/> 120 St. &amp; Broadway<lb/>
               <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York, N. Y.</rs>
               <salute>Dear <rs
                     ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr. Tillich</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>I am enclosing herewith a number of the letters that we have received on <q>War
                  Aims</q>.</p>
            <p>I know that you will be interested in reading them and would appreciate if you will
               return tham when you have had a chance to look through them.</p><closer>
               <salute>Sincerely,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__4219" type="person"
                  ><hi rend="hand">Sanford Archibald</hi> Sanford Archibald</rs></signed>
            SA:KK</closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
